# GSA Multiple Award Schedules (MAS) Consolidation

### The GSA has stated that on October 1, 2019 a new solicitation package will be issued for all GSA Schedule applicants.

### According to the GSA, all existing Schedule holders will be affected in some way by the mass consolidation.

The GSA Schedule experts at DKA can help guide you through these new developments, and make sure you’re properly positioned to receive contract awards under the new Consolidated Schedule.

### Over 500 GSA Schedules Awarded.

We’ve assisted more than 500 companies list and maintain their products and services on the GSA Schedule.

### DKA adds substantial value to its GSA Schedule clients.

Once your company is on the GSA Schedule, DKA can help you find contracts to pursue and help you successfully prepare and submit your proposals. Our GSA Schedule services include contract and proposal assistance, maintenance and more.

[Get Started Today](#contact)

